WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:04.720
We will now adjourn today's 
Lindworm Council meeting.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.470
Everyone is dismissed.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.100
Let us take our leave, Lady Draconness.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.870
Are you still trying to change my mind?

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:27.640
Yes. I really want you to undergo 
this surgery, no matter what.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.230
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:05.980
Case 11         Lindworm's Major Operation

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:04.820
Like this, Doctor?

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.340
Yes... Yes, delicately, just like that.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.940
Like you're gently pinching it.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:14.980
Yes, like that. This is a very 
important spot, so be very careful.

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:19.520
Very good. You've gotten a lot better.

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:24.090
Oh, you're too kind. It's all 
thanks to your guidance, Doctor.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:26.830
<i>She's way too close.</i>

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:33.070
Dr. Glenn, these exam records 
are all out of order.

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:34.720
S-Sorry.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.930
That's strange. I could've sworn I put
them in the same way I always do.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:40.080
I'll fix them.

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:43.860
More importantly, isn't it time for 
you to head to the Central Hospital?

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:48.680
Oh, you're right! I have to stop by 
the workshop and the council, too.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:50.550
What will you do about dinner?

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:54.120
I'm going to be pretty late, 
so I'll eat out somewhere.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.530
You guys can go ahead and eat without me.

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.640
Okay, I'll see you later.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:00.050
Have a good day.

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:03.780
Are you sure about this, Sapphee?

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.180
If you don't come right out and say,

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:11.240
"Look at me more! Pay attention 
to me," men will never catch on.

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:15.750
That's fine. It's not like me 
staying behind is anything new.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.140
Oh, really? Whatever do you mean?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:23.420
When I first left his home, 
I thought I'd never see him again.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:29.640
Until we reunited at the academy, 
I was basically all alone.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.620
But now, as long as I wait here, 
I'll always be able to see Dr. Glenn.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.640
He'll always come home to me.

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:41.310
I see. Dr. Glenn sure is loved, isn't he?

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.360
Yes. Which means there's 
no room for you to butt in.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.760
I must say, I'm a little envious.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.670
Thank you for everything 
you're doing, Arahnia.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.410
It's good to take a breather 
every now and then, though.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.930
It's been a while since 
we've been here, hasn't it?

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:58.540
Indeed, it has...

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.890
But why is she here, too?

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:05.740
Well, we're having a girls' night out.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:08.260
It's not like you two don't know 
each other, so I thought, why not?

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:11.380
I'm honored that you invited me, Sapphee.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:14.880
We're at a pub. Why are you 
drinkin' that red juice?

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:18.320
I do not partake in alcohol.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.100
Well, whatever.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:24.040
It's not like the alcohol will taste 
any less sweet with you here.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:28.850
Yes. Since it's just us girls tonight, 
feel free to talk about whatever you'd like.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:35.420
By the way, Sapphee, did that 
connection end up being helpful?

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:39.100
Yes. The ingredients you 
helped us procure allowed us

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.370
to come up with something 
that works on dragons.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.030
What're you talkin' about?

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:45.440
An anesthetic for Lady Skadi.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:49.500
There are absolutely no records of 
surgeries being done on dragons.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.190
Using the Scythia Trading 
Company's connections,

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.990
we were able to get a handful 
of ingredients for anesthetic

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:58.430
from some humans in the East.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.310
And the first ingredient is...

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.070
What in the world?

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:06.190
It's that alcohol called "ginjo."

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.200
It's a kind of alcohol made in the East,

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.460
and we learned that it has 
a sedative effect on dragons.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:13.860
Oho...

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:19.580
So if you use this Eastern alcohol, 
it could act as an anesthetic for Lady Skadi?

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:22.530
Yes, though we have yet 
to actually try it out.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:23.720
Say, miss,

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.580
could I get another ginjo?

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:28.350
Arahnia, I think you've 
had too much to drink.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:32.760
Oh, come on, now. I'm just gettin' started!

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:35.650
Is she always like this?

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:38.350
I think she's usually a bit tamer.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.950
Say, Miss Arahnia.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:47.270
Do you remember when you asked me 
if my love for the doctor was real?

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:49.990
Yup. I sure do.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:54.500
Then do you know what real love actually is?

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.920
Who can say?

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:04.280
I just adore the give and 
take of love and romance.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:07.800
But is there actually a "real" or "fake" to it?

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:11.370
A red thread binding your pinkies is 
supposed to be the sign of lovers.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.410
But I can connect with anyone I want,

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.550
any time I want, with my thread, 
even if it lacks color.

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:18.690
I don't even care if it's a guy or a girl.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:21.090
See? Even with girls...

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:27.560
Now our pinkies are linked, 
so we're BFFs forever.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.120
Right, Sapphee?

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.330
Don't you dare.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.160
You didn't even set a trap in the hallway.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:01.370
That's awfully careless of you, Arahnia.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.470
Sapphee... How did you know?

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.880
What happened to your slight accent?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.780
You're not even using your usual excuses.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:13.360
That's not like you at all.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.940
It's fine when you do things

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:19.720
like hide Dr. Glenn's stethoscope or 
rearrange his examination records.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:22.120
I'm willing to overlook pranks like that.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.800
But that's the one thing 
I can't let you have.

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:28.940
Because that's something very 
precious that I gave to Dr. Glenn.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.900
I've been waiting for you.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.900
Give up, Arahnia.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.970
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.950
I-I stole something,

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:14.840
but you're not handin' me 
over to the security police?

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:19.050
My, my. Miss Arahnia didn't actually 
steal anything, did she, Sapphee?

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:21.110
Indeed. She returned it immediately.

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.110
Yeah, but...

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:25.740
And now your little accent is back.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:29.070
Even though you just came up 
with it to hide your true self,

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.060
I must say, it suits you quite well.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:37.860
I know we've been asking a lot 
of you, and you've been stressed.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:41.630
So I was worried your bad 
habit might come out.

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:44.610
Guess you saw right through me.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.490
Yes, I've always been like this.

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:51.650
The closer I am with someone,

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:56.600
the more I can't help but 
want to take what is theirs.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:59.370
But that's not all, is it?

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:06.410
You tried to test me back at the harpy 
village by trying to make Dr. Glenn your own.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.720
To see if I'd still be friends with you,

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:13.040
or if I'd leave you like a broken thread.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:14.930
That's what you were doing, isn't it?

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:15.610
Yes...

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:18.440
What a cowardly thing to do.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.950
Yes, she is a coward.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:25.740
She's always longing for someone 
to need her, to forgive her.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:31.310
There's no value in a connection you 
can make with just anyone at any time.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.260
You know that deep down inside.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.880
This might not mean much to you,

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:40.920
but I have never doubted my friendship 
with Kay and Lorna even once.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:44.880
That's because I trust them.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:47.690
And they trust me.

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.680
You shouldn't have to test a bond.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:53.490
It should be something 
you constantly strengthen.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:58.180
Remember what you said 
the other day, Arahnia?

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:01.860
That we'd be BFFs forever because 
our pinkies were connected.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.620
Why don't you try believing
that, not just saying it?

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:28.090
So the reason you tried to steal the 
dragon scale was also to test the doctor?

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:29.410
Correct.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:32.130
I knew it was somethin' important 
that Sapphee gave him,

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.850
which was all the more reason.

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:36.490
What are we going to do with you?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:39.640
Even if you had succeeded in stealing that,

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:43.480
you still wouldn't fully trust us, would you?

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:47.240
I probably would've assumed you 
were just keepin' me around

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:52.180
until the surgery was over 'cause 
y'all needed my help with it.

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:53.680
Why are you like this?

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:58.680
But, I mean, you two don't 
really get him either, do you?

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.170
It confuses me to no end.

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:06.200
He just keeps kindly teachin' me every day,

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:09.340
as if he completely forgot what I did to him.

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:14.440
Even if I tease him or pull pranks, 
he never seems upset at all.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.570
On top of everything, he's such a softy.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.480
True.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:21.060
What confuses me is that you still 
can't trust him after all that.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:25.530
Well, unlike you, I don't trust a single soul.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:30.730
I'd love to find out what kinda secrets 
Dr. Glenn has hidden in the shadows.

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:34.410
You just got done crying, 
yet you're trying to sound all bad again.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:38.280
I think we've had enough of 
your sad attempt at villainy.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:41.930
Well, I'll be... You'll 
have to excuse me, then.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:48.390
I haven't been myself ever since I came here.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.020
I just can't relax when I'm around that doctor.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:55.060
Yet I don't seem to mind it, either.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:01.120
I know the doctor's not comfortable around 
me, but he doesn't even try to avoid me.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.250
Well, that'd be out of character for him.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:07.460
What's with that?! 
He doesn't see me as a bad girl?

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:10.950
I have no idea what goes 
on in that head of his!

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:16.080
Arahnia, let's conduct a little exam.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.740
E-Exam?

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:21.570
Do you recently find yourself thinking 
about Dr. Glenn before you go to sleep?

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:22.790
Y-Yes.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:26.840
Does your chest tighten? 
Does your face ever feel warm?

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:28.710
Now that you mention it, sometimes...

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:31.050
Do you have the urge to tie Dr. Glenn up?

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.580
All the time!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:39.290
Wh-What? What're you laughin' about?

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:40.570
You're sick.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.460
You mean my habit of takin' stuff, right? I know—

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.560
That's not what she meant.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:53.960
You've stolen men from their lovers 
before, and you still don't know?

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:57.540
I'm becomin' even more confused.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.720
I'm an expert when it comes to seducin' them,

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:02.450
but I don't have any experience 
with what comes after.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:04.950
I've always just been satisfied 
with stealin' them away.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:05.760
Goodness.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.320
My, my...

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.220
Huh? Wh-What's with you two?!

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:17.030
Arahnia, Tisalia and I have already been 
through what you're experiencing now.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:21.710
I'll go ahead and diagnose 
you. Your illness is...

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:24.360
that you're head over heels 
in love with Dr. Glenn.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:26.600
Huh?!

00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:41.380
You just don't give up. Don't you get 
tired of coming here day after day?

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:44.250
Well, I have yet to achieve my goal.

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:46.640
I see. I suppose that is true.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.910
Kunai, lift me.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:56.140
Um... Would you like me to pick you up?

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:59.400
Please.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:07.690
Dr. Glenn, do you mind if I tell 
you why I refuse the surgery?

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:09.150
Yes, I'd love to hear why.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.060
This is Lindworm.

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:15.810
It accepts all humans and 
monsters without bias.

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:19.140
I spent ten years making this city.

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:23.700
Yes. I agree that it's one of the best 
places to live in the whole land.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:29.920
I, as a dragon, wished for that. 
I never liked wars.

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:34.590
I descended from heaven to stop the war.

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:37.610
I took on a dragon form to act 
as an arbiter between both sides.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.250
Sometimes, I would intervene 
to keep the peace.

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:45.200
After intervening with the humans 
for so long, I ended up in this form.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:49.660
If I'd returned to heaven, I should've 
been able to maintain my dragon form,

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:55.020
but I wanted to stay on the surface and 
live among the humans and monsters.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.210
I wanted to observe them longer.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.950
After that hundred-year war ended,

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:06.140
I decided to make a city here that 
would never go to war itself.

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:10.180
I reformed this former fortress town so that 
humans and monsters could live together

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.580
and gave it the name of a dragon.

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:14.720
The name means, "May the dragons protect you."

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:18.510
This city continues to grow.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:23.640
Humans and monsters now 
need each other to survive.

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:26.960
That's why... That's why this 
is more than enough for me.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:29.500
Fate will catch up with everyone someday.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:34.040
And that's why you're refusing the surgery?

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:39.280
You created a city that won't go to war, 
and everything went wonderfully.

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:41.770
But when you got sick 
after achieving your goals,

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:43.750
you gave up, thinking it's your time to die.

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:45.760
Is that really okay, though?

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.590
Dr. Glenn...

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:52.600
Miss Kunai, more than anyone else, 
is always looking out for you.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:57.100
Dr. Cthulhy is at her wits' end trying to 
figure out how to make this surgery a success.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:00.480
Memé and the other blacksmiths are working 
through the night to make the tools.

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:05.350
Lulala continues to sing at the Central 
Council Hall, praying that you get better.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:10.080
The citizens of Lindworm are all 
good people and good monsters.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:13.180
Wouldn't you like to watch 
this city's progress a bit longer?

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:19.370
I'd like you to keep watching and
see how this charming city ends up.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.750
I want you to continue watching over us.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:24.240
This isn't your time.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.490
Your ailment is curable.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:32.000
That means that it's not 
your fate to die just yet.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:37.470
Lady Skadi, if you have any intention at 
all of continuing to watch over this city,

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.950
would you allow us to assist 
you in that endeavor?

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:46.260
Really? Is it really all right 
for me to continue living

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:48.260
a little bit longer?

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.770
Of course.

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:57.650
But Dr. Glenn, you have no idea how 
boring it is to live a long life.

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:58.970
O-Oh...

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:01.360
What exactly should I do?

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.550
W-Well, let's see...

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:07.180
Maybe eat delicious foods or sweets?

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:12.040
I heard that there's a new sweets 
café in the renovated waterways.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.790
What else could I do?

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:16.450
Well, since you're a girl, 
you could get all fancied up?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.470
It'll cost money, but perhaps buy some jewels?

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:22.850
Yes, jewels are good. 
Sparkly things are good.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.680
What else?

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:25.190
What else is there?

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:28.010
What do normal girls like?

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:33.560
U-Um... Romance, perhaps?

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:39.940
Hm... I see.

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:42.710
I will take that under advisement. Also...

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.540
Could you put me down now?

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:45.960
Oh... Sure.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:55.640
Dr. Glenn, I will go 
through with the surgery.

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:57.460
I'll be in your care.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.440
Yes. I'll make sure you're taken care of.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.240
I'm truly counting on you.

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:15.560
We will now begin our surgery on 
Skadi Dragenfelt to remove her tumor.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:17.340
Saphentite, how's the 
anesthesia coming along?

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.200
It seems to be working better than I expected.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.480
Her pulse and blood pressure are both stable.

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:25.000
Very good. Then let us begin.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:25.890
Yes.

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.820
It's probably hard to imagine since 
you know her in this form,

00:18:57.480 --> 00:19:00.430
but Skadi's original form 
was a standard fire dragon.

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.040
She'd be categorized as a 
dragon that breathes fire.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:09.250
What allows her to produce those flames 
is the flammable noxious gases within her.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:13.790
And that's why fire dragons' 
internal organs are shielded

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:18.350
by pyrite and vivianite to 
protect them from those gases.

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:23.200
The reason Skadi's internal 
organs and blood are blue

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.970
is because they contain those minerals.

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:30.470
I'm done over here, Glenn.

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:32.560
Almost done with the sutures 
to stop the bleeding.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.310
I'm also done.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:37.510
Very good. Now, let us concentrate 
on removing the tumor itself.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:43.040
Lady Cthulhy, her body temperature 
and blood pressure have rapidly shot up!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:45.720
And there it is. Glenn, take a look.

00:19:46.270 --> 00:19:47.280
That's...

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:51.420
When fire dragons sense they're in danger,

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:54.170
their body temperatures increase 
so they can breathe fire at any time.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:56.910
At this point, combustion 
can happen at any moment.

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:58.680
Even though she's anesthetized?

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:00.300
Her instincts are at work.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:03.600
Much like how our temperatures 
rise when we catch a cold.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.920
Ugh... I see dragon biology 
is as ridiculous as ever.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:12.900
Sapphee, Arahnia.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:16.040
Both of you, step back. 
This heat is far too dangerous.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.030
All right, Glenn. Let's get this over with.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:23.150
I-In this state?!

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:25.410
Shouldn't we try to get her 
temperature down first?

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:26.900
You're a doctor! Don't wimp out now!

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:31.580
If she combusts, her internal organs 
will immediately catch fire.

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:34.070
We don't have time to hesitate!

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:45.410
Doctor!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:46.300
Glenn...

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:50.080
Sever it while I'm restraining her!

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:51.890
Quickly!

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:53.000
Right!

00:20:58.380 --> 00:20:59.690
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:03.360
<i>I can do this...</i>

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:06.260
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.140
Dr. Glenn...

00:23:01.090 --> 00:23:03.100
It's okay. The surgery was a success.

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:07.940
Hey, everyone!

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:12.210
The surgery was a success! 
Lady Draconness is saved!

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:16.080
Way to go, Dr. Glenn!

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:19.050
Thank goodness... Thank goodness...

00:23:19.050 --> 00:23:20.920
Isn't that great, Memé?

00:23:24.300 --> 00:23:26.250
Your eye's scary!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Case 12        The City of Dragons' Doctor

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:39.390
Case 12: "The City of Dragons' Doctor."
